apshot and structured plan.\",\n    \"Compared proposed reconstruction semantics with the accepted P03 interface and normative language description.\",\n    \"Identified one material adapter ambiguity and concrete tests that expose it.\"\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"REVISE: explicitly preserve P03's non-exhaustive conditional alternatives. Endpoint-only checks would not detect accidental loss of the parent family's interior histories.\",\n  \"verdict\": \"REVISE\"\n}\n\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/review_plan-1.response.json {\n  \"assumptions\": [\n    \"Approval covers the bounded P04 implementation plan, not implementation correctness or phase acceptance.\",\n    \"Implementation requires an authorised writable environment and a supervisor-provided execution inventory before protection checks can pass.\"\n  ],\n  \"checks\": [\n    \"Read the recovery snapshot, complete prior review, revised structured plan and successful planner process record; verified required P04 deliverables and implementation modules remain absent.\",\n    \"Verified that P03 emits choice_group=null for named alternatives and retains parent constraints separately. Chapter 6 explicitly preserves every alpha in [0,1].\",\n    \"Confirmed the revision addresses every prior finding: independent parent and conditional queries, explicit intersection/union, overlapping views, interior feasibility, query isolation and coverage independent of view labels.\",\n    \"Audited baselines and comparison fairness: independent Fraction enumeration and analytic bounds test generated constraints against original inputs; authored final answers and solver success are insufficient.\",\n    \"Audited proxy promotion and stopping rules: unknown proofs, unfinished cells and unresolved obligations prevent exact certification; failed cases trigger repair.\",\n    \"Audited hidden defaults, stale context and environment: request-level budgets, rounding, integer bounds and scope are explicit; Z3